ik modul-tak-punya-direktori-docs-belum-ada-ik-sama-sekali|docs/ -- ssi_l10n_id_taxform_bukti_potong_pph_mixin ships one concrete master-data model (l10n_id.bukti_potong_pph_type) besides two AbstractModel mixins, but this module itself defines zero ir.actions.act_window and zero actioned menuitem for that model: menu.xml only declares the empty parent folder menu bukpot_configuration_menu (no action=), and views/bukti_potong_pph_type_views.xml only inherits mode="primary" tree/search/form views (styling & field patches), never an act_window record. The only reachable entry points for l10n_id.bukti_potong_pph_type in the whole repo are provided by six downstream modules (ssi_l10n_id_taxform_bukti_potong_pph_f113301/f113302/f113304/f113306/f113308/f113310), each exposing a single fixed-record form action (res_id=<one record>, create=0, delete=0) scoped to their own tax form type. A Work Instruction for opening/editing that model therefore belongs to those downstream modules' own docs/ (out of scope for issue #134, which explicitly excludes other modules in this repo), not to this mixin module, which has no click-flow of its own to document.
